WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:07.565
Open the wall elevation of a wall you have measured.

2
00:00:08.065 --> 00:00:13.768
Tap "Suggest wainscoting": the app divides the wall into equal frames.

3
00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:19.973
Adjust the width of the moulding and the gap.

4
00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:26.738
Choose "Two rows" and set the space between the rows.

5
00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:35.538
Put a chair rail above, or add an extra rail at a height of your own with "Add a rail".

6
00:00:36.038 --> 00:00:41.739
With "Marking measurements" you see the measurements for each frame to mark out on the wall.

7
00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:47.945
The cutting list and the materials are below it; split the list with "Split cutting list".

8
00:00:48.445 --> 00:01:05.426
Prefer an example? Choose "From a photo" and a photo of a wall you like.

9
00:01:05.876 --> 00:01:10.733
In this video the AI's reply is simulated.

